      "message": "[error] Line 740: 🔴 libyrs is a Rust static library, but only -ldl and -lm are linked on non-MSVC and no platform-specific private dependencies are handled. This will fail or be brittle across Linux/macOS/MSVC; consume the yrs pkg-config/CMake metadata from contrib, or otherwise import all Libs.private/system framework dependencies for the selected platform.",
